WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.750
Computers for your agents.
Linux VMs, locally or remotely.

00:03.750 --> 00:07.500
Choose its repositories and API credentials.
Configured on the hosting computer.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.250
Start, stop and restart the remote VM
from your laptop.

00:11.250 --> 00:15.000
Your editor. Your terminal.
Connected to the VM over SSH.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.875
Connect VM port 3000.

00:17.875 --> 00:20.625
A server in the VM.
An address on your laptop.

00:20.625 --> 00:24.560
Give agents a Linux desktop.
Test the same app inside the VM.

00:24.560 --> 00:28.125
The agent clicks Checkout
and verifies the result.

00:28.125 --> 00:30.000
Less setup. More building.

00:30.000 --> 00:33.750
Silo. Computers for your agents.
silo.polarzero.xyz · macOS + Linux
